## Import

{{ codefile "shell" "examples/resources/sapintegrationsuite_partner_authorized_user/import.sh" }}

The ID is the user, in lowercase. Everything is recovered.

## Limitations

- **SAP:** users are stored lowercased (SAP's own example creates `MyUser` and returns
  `myuser`); the provider rejects uppercase letters at plan time.
- **Provider:** Edge Integration Cell targeting through `runtime_location_id` is not supported and has not
  been tested; leave it unset.

